   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Do a ?geom_text in your console to read the manual. <div><br></div><div>It&#39;s like this:</div><div><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.333333015441895px\">df &lt;- data.frame(\r\n  x = factor(c(1, 1, 2, 2)),\r\n  y = c(1, 3, 2, 1),\r\n  grp = c(&quot;a&quot;, &quot;b&quot;, &quot;a&quot;, &quot;b&quot;)\r\n)</pre></div><div><div>ggplot(df) + geom_point(aes(x=x, y=y)) + geom_text(aes(x=x,y=y,label=grp),hjust=-0.7,vjust=-0.1,angle=45,size=12)</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><br>On Wednesday, November 23, 2016 at 9:13:14 AM UTC-6, cqzan wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-x30hL-rp5pE/WDWwSDhL9rI/AAAAAAAAABE/8xj3w9xefSwAwhyBZcPZzkmQIVps8DO1QCLcB/s1600/label.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-x30hL-rp5pE/WDWwSDhL9rI/AAAAAAAAABE/8xj3w9xefSwAwhyBZcPZzkmQIVps8DO1QCLcB/s1600/label.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367553691000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1C2aIk1Y9T-d5t0_H66lq1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-x30hL-rp5pE/WDWwSDhL9rI/AAAAAAAAABE/8xj3w9xefSwAwhyBZcPZzkmQIVps8DO1QCLcB/s320/label.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"271\" height=\"320\"></a></p>thanyou .</blockquote></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
